## v1.0.0 — Initial Release

First public build. Requires an active license (HWID-locked) — contact the seller for a key if you don't have one yet.

### Features
- **Automation macros** — build unlimited custom macros per game window, with independent hotkeys and per-window/per-preset targeting
- **AutoPot / AutoCharm / AutoAttack** — reads HP/MP/Level straight from the game client so pots and charms fire automatically at your thresholds
- **Auto Heal** and **Auto Mobs** — always-on background helpers, independent of the main Start/Stop toggle
- **Follow system** — assist targeting across party slots (PM1–PM5), shared per preset
- **Multi-window support** — auto-detect and arrange every open game window, run macros across all of them, "nail" windows in place
- **Built-in auto-updater** — the app checks for new versions on launch and, before installing one, automatically backs up your current build *and* your settings into a timestamped `backup_YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS` folder

### Setup
1. Run the app and log in with the account/login your license was issued under
2. First launch may take a moment while it grabs your machine's HWID and verifies your license
3. Open Settings to configure macros, hotkeys, and window bindings for your setup

### Known limitations
- Windows only
- One license per HWID — reinstalling Windows will require re-issuing your license

---
Found a bug? Report it to the seller with your login and a description of what happened.
